BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (couple of crap leads, because messaging, pricing and case studies were still UK-only. Their fix is aligning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (sales and the deck before buying reach in a new market, and they warn that a Wynter survey at GBP 5,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (to GBP 6,000 is not cheap either [5XU6PUsdwEM @ 00:15:26]. The B2B Playbook draws the deal-size line) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (bluntly: a $500 product cannot fund a $150,000 to $200,000 salesperson, and ABM starts paying off around) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm ($10K a year and up [TMEMDzAg5QA @ 00:12:13]. Bev Burgess says fit follows deal size, not company) Tj ET
