BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Where Practitioners Disagree & Alternative Playbooks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 693.77 Tm (The sharpest split is over which attribution model deserves trust. Chris Walker ran early PatientPop on plain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 678.55 Tm (last touch because the sales cycle was about nine days, and the rule was to pick one model and stay) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 663.32 Tm (consistent rather than chase sophistication, while admitting the team was never super confident a better) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (method existed [wkcuqfylydw @ 00:01:29]. Milton Anthony of SalesLabX runs the opposite playbook inside) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (Salesforce for cycles past 90 days: turn every model on, rank primary campaign source dead last as myopic,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (distrust data-driven as a black box, and start from even distribution before digging into outliers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm ([JkmlKUCHcmA @ 00:36:46] [JkmlKUCHcmA @ 00:40:31]. Sarah Lane-Hawn on Value-First rejects both) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (off-the-shelf extremes for HubSpot Pro shops, building a Goldilocks model that tracks 12 baseline channels,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (rolls revenue up to exactly 100 percent, and hands the board non-squishy numbers, because channel-level) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (influenced revenue never adds up to the total [NZUqq5BtQuU @ 00:10:58]. The operator read is simple.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (Short cycles tolerate a single-touch rule as long as it is applied consistently. Long, multi-contact cycles push) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (toward even distribution or a custom split that totals cleanly, and the model has to be locked before anyone) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (argues about what the output says.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (Practitioners also split on how much weight attribution should carry at all. Passetto opens with the hard truth) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (that attribution is more part of the problem than the solution, argues that 2026 buyers are being measured) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (with an early-2000s system, and demotes attribution to an ancillary, directional input rather than the primary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (KPI [IYxZQrk554A @ 00:00:17]. The replacement is revenue visibility: stage progression, bottlenecks, SDR) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (follow-up speed and cohorted data that finance can use, which Passetto describes as hard to implement but) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (easy to interpret, the exact reverse of attribution. Value-First still calls multi-touch absolutely required) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (because boards want clean snapshots, yet the host warns against building attribution to prove the value of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (marketing and frames the output as a snapshot for board conversations rather than the full picture) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm ([NZUqq5BtQuU @ 00:22:59]. Chris Walker sits in the pragmatic middle: the payoff of a consistent model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (was simply separating inbound, channel partner, reseller, outbound and self-generated deals so channel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (efficiency could be compared at all [wkcuqfylydw @ 00:01:43]. The working playbook blends the camps: use) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (attribution to rank channels directionally, then run the stress test Passetto closes on, which asks whether) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (you could confidently place an extra $1M of budget on what the numbers show [IYxZQrk554A @ 00:17:10].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (Platform choice divides along admin capacity and how much autonomy to hand the machines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (VerifiedShortlist's rule of thumb is HubSpot when there is no admin and the motion is inbound-led,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (Salesforce for complex customization or more than 50 reps, with the blunt warning that Salesforce's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (flexibility is a liability without someone to own it [aGsk3Ma7_PA @ 00:04:10]. Shashank Sharma of Xpedify,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (appearing on Instantly, takes a third path entirely: an automation builder with a CRM built in that fills gaps in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (HubSpot, Zoho and Salesforce, using Claude MCP chat to build workflows and dashboards, with AI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (call-backs inside 2 minutes as the top workflow [FOr5YL0hYJE @ 00:11:32]. On AI sellers, the Outreach) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (CEO interviewed by Chris Bussing frames agents as hires with pre-built skills that augment people rather) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (than replace them, pointing to 1.5 billion euros of SAP pipeline and 100 percent adoption [EQhwdsXidcQ @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (00:01:51]. Ambilio keeps the human firmly on the hook instead: every research pin carries a source and) Tj ET
